  "content": "\n\n<p>《Extended Tinker》擴充模組嘗試將 Tinkers' Construct 擴展至 Minecraft 中那些不起眼的角落。</p>\n<p>例如：工匠馬甲、為《Ice and Fire》打造的工匠龍甲，以及為《Modular Golems》打造的工匠魔像甲。</p>\n<p>未來將會新增更多工具與功能。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1335926/description_824762df-dcdb-4c2d-a02a-51769cb6a96a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"428\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1335926/description_6dbb534a-2887-4184-8808-cc0a2a50b031.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
